# Coming from react-advanced-cropper

Start with these three changes. Before examples use the previous framework API; after examples use Svelte 5.

## Stencil child

Before:

```tsx
<Cropper stencilComponent={CircleStencil} stencilProps={{ movable: false }} />
```

After:

```svelte
<Cropper>
	<CircleStencil movable={false} />
</Cropper>
```

## Layer snippet

Before:

```tsx
<Cropper wrapperComponent={CustomWrapper} />
```

After:

```svelte
<Cropper>
	{#snippet wrapper(props)}
		<CustomWrapper {...props} />
	{/snippet}
</Cropper>
```

The custom wrapper must render `props.children()` and preserve supplied styling.

## Instance binding

Before:

```tsx
const cropper = useRef<CropperRef>(null);
<Cropper ref={cropper} />;
```

After:

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { Cropper, type CropperInstance } from 'svelte-advanced-cropper';

	let cropper: CropperInstance | undefined = $state();
	const coordinates = $derived(cropper?.getCoordinates());
</script>

<Cropper bind:this={cropper} src="/photo.jpg" style="height: 360px" />
```

## Migration checklist

Require Svelte `^5.40`, import `svelte-advanced-cropper/style.css`, and give the cropper a definite height. Keep built-in settings as flat props; use `settings` for typed extension values only. Replace component/props bags with child stencils and snippets, then update styling and source registration.

`setCoordinates` still accepts functional and sequential updates. `setImage` takes a plain image value. There is no `bind:coordinates`. `CropperPreview {cropper}` reads the bound instance directly; loading/loaded remain valid preview snapshot props.

The exhaustive tables also cover the Svelte 0.1.x API. Names below match the implemented package exports.

<details>
<summary>Complete export mapping</summary>

| Old export | 0.2.0 name or concept |
|---|---|
| `CropperRef<E>` | `CropperInstance<E>` |
| `CustomCropperRef<E>` | `CropperInstance<E>` |
| `FixedCropperRef` | `FixedCropperInstance<E>` |
| `AbstractCropperRef<S>` | `CropperInstance<E>`, where the settings extension is `E` |
| Runtime `CropperInstance` class | Internal `CropperController`; public `CropperInstance` is type-only |
| `CropperInstanceProps` | Internal controller configuration; use `CropperProps<E>` |
| `AbstractCropper` | `Cropper` with settings, algorithms and layer snippets |
| `AbstractCropperProps<S>` | `CropperProps<E>` |
| `AbstractCropperIntrinsicProps<S>` | `CropperProps<E>` |
| `AbstractCropperSettings` | `CropperSettings` |
| `AbstractCropperSettingsProp<S>` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>` |
| `CustomCropperProps<E>` | `CropperProps<E>` |
| `CropperInstanceSettings` | `CropperSettings` |
| `CropperInstanceSettingsProp<S>` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>` |
| `CropperPreviewRef` | `CropperPreviewInstance` |
| `CropperPreviewDesiredCropperRef` | `CropperPreviewSource` |
| `DraggableElement` / duplicate `DraggableArea` | `DraggableArea`, with `DraggableAreaProps` |
| `DraggableElementProps` | `DraggableAreaProps` |
| `StretchableBoundaryMethods` | `BoundaryHandle` |
| `ArbitraryProps` | No catch-all replacement; type the component’s own props |
| `StencilComponent` | Ordinary child component; no library-specific component type |
| `CropperWrapperComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E>]>` |
| `CropperWrapperComponentProps` | `CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E>` |
| `CropperBoundaryComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperBoundarySnippetProps<E>]>` |
| `CropperBackgroundComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperBackgroundSnippetProps<E>]>` |
| `CropperBackgroundWrapperComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperBackgroundWrapperSnippetProps<E>]>` |
| `CropperBackgroundWrapperComponentProps` | `CropperBackgroundWrapperSnippetProps<E>` |
| `HandlerComponent` | `Snippet<[HandlerSnippetProps]>` |
| `HandlerComponentProps` | `HandlerSnippetProps` for snippets; `HandlerWrapperProps` for that component |
| `LineComponent` | `Snippet<[LineSnippetProps]>` |
| `LineComponentProps` | `LineSnippetProps` for snippets; `LineWrapperProps` for that component |
| `HandlerClassNames`, `LineClassNames` | Root class plus documented selectors |
| `PreviewWrapperComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperPreviewWrapperSnippetProps]>` |
| `PreviewBackgroundComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperPreviewBackgroundSnippetProps]>` |
| `useAbstractCropper` | Compose `Cropper`; descendants use context |
| `AbstractCropperHookProps`, `AbstractCropperRefs` | `CropperProps<E>` and typed layer registrations |
| `useCropperInstance`, `CropperStateHook` | Component instance for Svelte composition; core API for independently owned headless integration |
| `useCropperImage` | Cropper loading props/status; independently managed images use core loading utilities |
| `CropperImageHook`, `CropperImageHookSettings` | No public loader abstraction replacement |
| `useMoveImageOptions`, `DefinedMoveImageOptions` | `normalizeMoveImageOptions`; result `NormalizedMoveImageOptions` |
| `useScaleImageOptions`, `DefinedScaleImageOptions` | `normalizeScaleImageOptions`; result `NormalizedScaleImageOptions` |
| `useRotateImageOptions`, `DefinedRotateImageOptions` | `normalizeRotateImageOptions`; result `NormalizedRotateImageOptions` |
| `useUpdateEffect` | Internal only; application effects express their own dependency/lifetime requirements |
| `useWindowResize` | Element dimension bindings or `<svelte:window>` listeners |
| `ExtendedSettings<E>` | `CropperSettings<E>` |
| `CropperCanvas`, `CropperCanvasMethods` | Internal; call `CropperInstance.getCanvas()` |
| `ArtificialTransition` and its props | Internal; compose `StencilWrapper` |
| `PreviewBoundaryComponent` | `Snippet<[CropperPreviewBoundarySnippetProps]>` |
| `HandlerWrapper.onDrag`, `LineWrapper.onDrag` | `onMove` with the native event |
| `HandlerWrapper.onDragEnd`, `LineWrapper.onDragEnd` | `onMoveEnd` |

</details>

<details>
<summary>Complete prop mapping</summary>

| Owner and old prop | Replacement |
|---|---|
| React component `ref` | `bind:this`, typed as `CropperInstance<E>` |
| React `className` | `class: ClassValue` |
| React object `style` | `style: string` |
| Cropper/FixedCropper `stencilComponent` | Child stencil |
| `stencilProps` | Direct props on that child |
| `wrapperComponent`, `wrapperProps` | `wrapper` snippet; pass local values directly |
| `boundaryComponent`, `boundaryProps` | `boundary` snippet |
| `backgroundWrapperComponent`, `backgroundWrapperProps` | `backgroundWrapper` snippet |
| `backgroundComponent`, `backgroundProps` | `background` snippet |
| `boundaryClassName` | Cropper root class + `.advanced-cropper__boundary` |
| `backgroundWrapperClassName` | Root class + `.advanced-cropper__background-wrapper` |
| `backgroundClassName` | Root class + `.advanced-cropper__background` |
| Leaked `getInstance` callback prop | Removed; instance ownership is internal |
| Stencil injected `cropper` | `getCropperContext().cropper` |
| Stencil injected `image` | `getCropperContext().image` |
| Stencil exported `aspectRatio`, `boundingBox` | `registerStencil(() => options)` |
| Stencil `handlerComponent` | `handler` snippet |
| Stencil `lineComponent` | `line` snippet |
| BoundingBox `handlerComponent`, `lineComponent` | `handler`, `line` snippets |
| `handlerClassNames`, `handlerWrapperClassNames` | Class on owning stencil/box; handler and direction selectors |
| `lineClassNames`, `lineWrapperClassNames` | Class on owning stencil/box; line and direction selectors |
| Stencil `movingClassName`, `resizingClassName` | Existing `--moving`, `--resizing` selectors |
| Stencil `gridClassName` | `__grid` selector |
| Stencil `previewClassName` | `__preview` selector |
| Stencil `boundingBoxClassName` | `__bounding-box` selector |
| Stencil `overlayClassName` | `__overlay` selector |
| Stencil `draggableAreaClassName` | `__draggable-area` selector |
| SimpleHandler/SimpleLine `defaultClassName` | Root `class`, targeting the inner visual when necessary |
| SimpleHandler/SimpleLine `hoverClassName` | Documented hover modifier |
| SimpleHandler/SimpleLine `wrapperClassName` | Root `class` |
| SimpleHandler `wrapperStyle` | Root `style` |
| StretchableBoundary `stretcherClassName` | Root class + `__stretcher` |
| StretchableBoundary `contentClassName` | Root class + `__content` |
| CropperBackgroundImage `ref` / `bind:ref` | `attachSource` attachment |
| CropperSource `ref` / `bind:ref` | `element / bind:element, typed HTMLImageElement` \| `null` |
| Deprecated custom-wrapper `loading`, `loaded` | `cropper.isLoading()`, `cropper.isLoaded()` |
| CropperPreviewWrapper `cropper` | `preview` |
| CropperPreviewBackground `cropper` | `preview` |
| CropperPreview `wrapperComponent`, `wrapperProps` | `wrapper` snippet |
| CropperPreview `boundaryComponent`, `boundaryProps` | `boundary` snippet |
| CropperPreview `backgroundComponent`, `backgroundProps` | `background` snippet |
| CropperPreview `contentClassName` | Root class + `.advanced-cropper-preview__content` |
| CropperPreview `backgroundClassName` | Root class + `.advanced-cropper-preview__image` |
| CropperPreview `boundaryClassName` | Root class + `.advanced-cropper-preview__boundary` |
| `ScaleImageOptions.adjustStencil` | Remove this currently ignored field; use `transformImage.adjustStencil` |
| React deprecated `Cropper.stencilSize` | `FixedCropper.stencilSize` |
| React deprecated `Cropper.autoZoom` | Explicit `postProcess` configuration |


</details>

### Names already absent from Svelte 0.1

| React-only name | Svelte approach |
| --- | --- |
| `useForceRerender` | Reactive `$state` and `$derived` reads. |
| `usePersistentFunction` | Closures reading current props. |
| `useStateWithCallback` | State plus explicit application sequencing. |
| `useFirstMountState` | Initialization and lifecycle functions. |
| `createCropper` | Component composition with Cropper. |
| `mergeRefs` | Explicit element bindings and attachments. |

### Class-map keys and preserved behavior

Old `HandlerClassNames` and `LineClassNames` keys map as follows: `default` targets the visual class; `hover` and `disabled` use state modifiers; each direction uses its kebab-case modifier. See the [complete selector inventory](/docs/reference/styling).

Stencil `coordinates`, ratio props, `grid`, `movable`, `resizable`, `disabled`, `handlers` and `lines` remain. Both control collections accept booleans or direction maps. `useAnchor` remains a gesture option; it is not a public helper function.

Movement callbacks retain the native event. `onMove`, `onMoveEnd`, `onTransform`, `onTransformEnd` and `onEvent` remain. HandlerWrapper and LineWrapper specifically rename `onDrag`/`onDragEnd` to `onMove`/`onMoveEnd`.

The removed dependency-array observer is replaced by explicit effects fed by scalar `$derived` image identities and loading status. Initialization snapshots preserve changes made during mount while skipping unchanged initial values; unchanged derived values suppress notifications. Callbacks run untracked, and native effect teardown owns cleanup where needed. Cropper and preview handle both window resize and orientation change through `<svelte:window>`. Application-specific resize work can use element dimension bindings or window listeners.

Core root re-exports, `StencilOptions`, `StencilConstraints`, option types, `SettingsExtension`, `StencilSize`, `styleToString` and `fillLayoutBoundary` remain. The supported component set is listed by the [reference](/docs/reference/types-and-utilities); no controller constructor is public.
